5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning rush is becoming a physical hazard. We need to address the congestion immediately.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before we discuss solutions, we must understand the financial implications for the building.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I have noticed the same flats seem to hold the best spots. Is this fair?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let's not create a system that turns neighbors into rivals. We need stability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,Who is actually going to maintain whatever we decide? The last two jobs just stopped.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, cost is important, but safety is more urgent. We are blocking each other.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if we cannot afford the fix, the problem remains. I need to check the accounts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will look into the history of these allocations. It feels arbitrary.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I want to see what happens when these arrangements fail. I will check the complaints.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I need to know the workload. I will look at the treasurer's file and the minutes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will observe the morning departures and check the rain exposure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will review the building ledger and the ward cycle park costs.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will check the five years of minutes and the sticker register.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the complaint log and the neighbouring block's account.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will examine the treasurer's handover file and the supplier's display frame trial.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
