30,2,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Mio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,George,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"I watched the mornings. Four times, someone had to move a bike to leave. It is chaotic.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The ledger shows no capital funds. Any new structure needs a levy. The station park costs 2,600 yen.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,The minutes confirm the same flats held the covered spots for five years. No review was ever held.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The complaint log shows nine issues last year, all ignored. The block next door had people stop paying and attending meetings.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Mio,,The treasurer spends three hours a month on current cash. Adding billing would double that. The rack trial took twenty seconds per bike.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, twenty seconds is manageable. The rain exposure is the real issue for the uncovered spots.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@George, if the same flats held spots for five years, that is a precedent we need to break or formalize.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,The sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying. They do not want to be treated as equal claimants.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, if we charge, we risk the same social breakdown as the neighbours. People stop talking.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Mio,,"The physical effort of the racks is low, but the administrative burden of billing is high.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,We need a system that handles the morning rush without shoving. Shared racks might help.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Paid allocation brings in money, but the ledger is empty. We would need to raise funds first.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"A lottery seems fair on paper, but the daily riders want certainty. They are willing to pay for it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I am worried about the social cost. If we make it a paid service, we lose the community feel.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Mio,,"If we choose shared racks, who greases the springs? I can do it, but I don't want to be the only one.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,The rain is a factor. We need to prioritize the dry spots or protect the wet ones.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,The financial data suggests we cannot afford major changes without a levy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,"The history shows stagnation. We need a new rule, even if it is unpopular.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let's avoid a system that creates debtors and absentees. That is a bad outcome.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Mio,,I am leaning towards a solution that doesn't require constant cash handling.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
